                                <p class="text-xs text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-medium mb-1">Quotes</p>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white" id="dashboard-kpi-quotes-total-alt">-</h3>
